#### Integrate with Existing Routing and Navigation

Update the `client/src/app/registry.ts` to include the ELM module:

```typescript
// client/src/app/registry.ts
import { ModuleManifest } from './types';

const modules: ModuleManifest[] = [
  // Other modules
  {
    code: 'elm',
    basePath: '/api/v1/elm/',
    load: () => import('./modules/elm'),
  },
];

export default modules;
```

Update the `client/src/ui/layout/AppShellLayout.tsx` to include the ELM module in the navigation:

```tsx
// client/src/ui/layout/AppShellLayout.tsx
